NOTE ON DATA

This license covers the source code in this repository, including the taxonomy
files under /data that map vendor product names to categories.

It does NOT cover the vulnerability data the software ingests, which is
third-party and carries its own terms:

  - CVE records — the CVE Program (cve.org). CVE is a registered trademark of
    MITRE. Use is subject to the CVE Program Terms of Use and requires
    attribution.
  - Known Exploited Vulnerabilities catalog — CISA. U.S. Government work.
  - EPSS scores — FIRST.org. Free to use with citation; see first.org/epss.

Vendor and product names are trademarks of their respective owners and are used
nominatively to identify the products a vulnerability affects.
